23775,"Tax preparation made easier with one online report
Dear costumer: Tax preparation made easier with one online report Good news! Your last year's Annual Account Summary is now available for you to request online between February 1st and October 15th. This online report provides you with a comprehensive monthly overview of your entire year's spending. Just follow these steps to request your Annual Account Summary: Sign on to www.citicards.com. On the Account Activity tab, select View Account Activity in the drop-down menu. On the Account Activity page, in the Request an Annual Account Summary section at the bottom, click the Request button. A notification email will be sent in 24-48 hours when your report is available to view and download online at www.citicards.com. Sign On Now! NOTICE: The federal Equal Credit Opportunity Act prohibits creditors from discriminating against credit applicants on the basis of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, marital status, age (provided the applicant has the capacity to enter into a binding contract); because all or part of the applicant's income derives from any public assistance program; or because the applicant has in good faith exercised any right under the Consumer Credit Protection Act. The federal agency that administers compliance with this law concerning this creditor is the Office of the Comptroller of the Currency, Customer Assistance Group, 1301 McKinney Street, Suite 3450, Houston, Texas 77010-9050. The creditor is Citibank, N.A., 701 E. 60th St. N., Sioux Falls, SD 57104. Please direct any questions to the Customer Service address below.",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
