 CAN YOU ASSIST? Dear Friend, I am Barr Harris Keith, a British attorney at law the Principal Attorney of Y.Q. Associates UK. Deceased client of mine, by name ALH. Abdul Mohammed, who here in after shall be referred to as my client, died in Band Ace in Indonesia with all members of is family in the deadly Tsunami. Please log to this website for more about the Tsunamiwww.cnn.com/SPECIALS/2004/tsunami.disaster/news.bbc.co.uk/1/hi/in_depth/world/200.../default.semi am I contacting you to assist me in ensuring that the funds lodged by my client with financial Institution Abroad. The financial institution is not declared unclaimed hence my reason for contacting you. The financial institution has issued me a notice to contact the next of kin, or the Funds lodge BYM client will be confiscated. My proposition to you is to seek your consent to present you as the next-of-kin and beneficiary of my late client, so that the proceeds of this fund scan be transfer to you, Then we can share the funds and give half to the victim of the tsunami in Indonesia, As donation from my late client. I have all documents that show He deposits it with the financial institution. We will Sharon a mutually agreed-upon percentage. All legal documents to back up your claim as my client's next-of-kin will be provided. All I requires your honest cooperation to enable us see this transaction through. This will be executed under a legitimate arrangement that will protect you from any breach of the law. If this business proposition offends your moral values, doaccept my apology. Please contact me at once to indicate your interest.However, if you are willing to assist me in this venture. I will establish a verbal telephone communication with you and bring you into a much better picture of the situation. If you are willing to help me contact me via email address(earthlingchamber@netscape.net)Phone number:+447040116908Thank and God bless you. Barr. Harris Keith, Principal Attorney, Y.Q. Associates UK.------