y arise during the time of transfer and also telephone bills; while 60% will be for me. Please;you have been advice to keep top secret as I am still in service and intend to retire from service after we conclude this deal with you. I will be monitoring the whole situation here in this bank until you confirm the money in your account and ask me to come down to your country for subsequent sharing of the fund according to percentages previously indicated and further investment, either in your country or any country you advise unto invest. All other necessary vital information will be sent to you when there from you. Yours faithfully_________________________________________________________________Tested Windows Live Mail Beta ! http://www.msn.fr/newhotmail/Default.asp? Ath=f",i09,Software and Device Operations,"GENERAL SETTINGS
