Dear Customer, We know that you are concerned with how your personal and financial information is dealt with. This privacy statement sets out our current policies and demonstrates our commitment to your financial privacy. We may change the content or services found on our website at any time without notice, and consequently our privacy policy may change at any time in the future. You agree to revisit this page regularly and your continued access to or use of the website will mean that you agree to the changes. Service will not be interrupted and will continue as normal. Please continue to revisit your account and privacy statement by Clicking here <Agreement if you have any questions. Thank You. HSBC Account Review Department",i10,Service and Subscription Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
